## Symptom

On a tokenless (dev-mode) relay, the unsigned heartbeats missing-lease case returns HTTP 200 + unknown_alias instead of 404 + lease_not_found (relay.ml:5344; the B293 split was implemented only on the signed path via reject_session_lease_missing). Client re-register logic keyed on lease_not_found (the connectors) never triggers against a dev relay.

## Fix direction

Route the backend unknown_alias heartbeat result through the same 404/lease_not_found mapping in the unsigned arm.

